    <value>Data sharing and privacy</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Settings_Ai_Privacy_Help.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Recognized sensitive fields and credential patterns are masked before AI evidence and assistant audit details are shortened. Detection is not perfect: unlabelled or encoded secrets may remain. Review diagnosis previews and do not paste secrets into chat. The selected provider receives chat and tool evidence; local inference requires a local endpoint. Diagnosis fixes are copy-only; assistant mutations follow the app's approval settings.</value>
  </data>
