  </data>
  <data name="Settings_Ai_Ollama_Model_Header.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Ollama model (installed)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Settings_Ai_Ollama_Model_Help.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Downloads a model on the configured endpoint, which may be remote. Model names and tags can change over time, so a name alone does not tell you what you will get or whether it supports tool calling.</value>
